## 🚀 Quick Start

### 1. Backend Setup

```bash
cd server
npm install
# Create a .env file with MONGODB=<your_mongo_uri>
npm run dev
```

The server will run on `http://localhost:3000`.

### 2. Frontend Setup

```bash
cd client
npm install
npm run dev
```

The client will launch on `http://localhost:5173`, proxying `/api` calls directly to the server.
